<title>NEW ZEALAND: ANZ, Postbank cut NZ 1-yr fixed rate to 8.5 pct.</title>
<headline>ANZ, Postbank cut NZ 1-yr fixed rate to 8.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>ANZ Bank and Postbank said on Thursday they would cut their New Zealand one-year fixed mortgage rate to 8.5 percent from 8.7 percent, effective May 30.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734746</p>
</text>
